# Repository-root build context.
#
# Everything here is either irrelevant to a build or actively harmful in one: host-built
# dependencies that would shadow the container's own, build output, and local state.

.git/
.gitignore

# Documentation and specifications never affect a build.
specs/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Host-built dependencies. A node_modules from macOS inside a Linux container fails confusingly,
# and it is by far the largest thing that would otherwise be copied.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/

# Build output and local state.
backend/bin/
backend/.imagestore/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Local configuration and anything secret.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Editor, tooling, and OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.specify/
.qodo/
